Case 1a total: $147 + 53 + 11 = 211$.

## Final Count

$$\text{Total} = \underbrace{211}_{c_3=0,c_4=0} + \underbrace{25}_{c_3=0,c_4=1} + \underbrace{2}_{c_3=1} = \boxed{238}$$

